ion test since it's cheap-ish: I can trigger another redraw... hmm, actually the level is currently restarting (the card is up). It'll reload and the HUD will be redrawn again. \n\nActually, I realize the current screen IS the redraw proof — the WORLD 1-1 card with the HUD showing my written values. That's a great proof scre","truncated":true}
